  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math>.</p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></math></p><p>Similarly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msup></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is the order of the square matrix.</p><p>Let us find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>24</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
